// Package window (phase 0): [2021-01-01, ∞) — technical plan window (§4.3).
// Editions back-to-back from the start of coverage; earlier wordings only
// for third-party cases (there are none: no Catala PAJE models, OpenFisca
// cases are year 2025).
//
// Why SEVEN wordings for five articles. D. 531-2 changed on 01.04.2021
// (Decree 2021-368): the old wording paid prime naissance AFTER birth
// («versée avant la fin du dernier jour du second mois civil suivant la
// naissance»), the new one removed it — since 16.12.2020 L. 531-2 pays
// BEFORE birth («avant le dernier jour du mois civil suivant le sixième
// mois»). R. 531-1 changed on 29.10.2022 (Decree 2022-1370) purely
// editorially («par arrêté» removed from paragraph 3) — same semantics,
// both wordings pinned. NOTA of L. 531-2 (Law 2020-1576, Art. 75 II–III):
// applies to pregnancies from 01.10.2020; the transitional April 2021
// payment for 06–09.2020 pregnancies is a package boundary (paid out,
// no rule built).
//
// Wave 3 (part 2) adds the base allowance (L. 531-3/D. 531-3, both the
// 2018 and the 2015 wordings — the latter still governs pre-2018 children
// until 01.04.2021) and PreParE (L. 531-4, L. 531-4-1 ×2, L. 531-1 context,
// R. 531-2…R. 531-4, D. 531-4…D. 531-11, D. 531-13…D. 531-16-1).
// Renderer fix (wave 3): LEGI writes some articles with no `<p>` (sentence
// directly in CONTENU, `<br/>`-separated); the wave-1 walk read only `<p>`
// and pinned D. 531-1 and R. 531-3 EMPTY. The fixed walk also reads CONTENU
// head text and `<br/>` tails; the six non-empty wave-1 documents rebuild
// byte-identical, D. 531-1 regains its three-year sentence.
//
// OUT OF SCOPE (neighbouring packages / boundaries — see package.law):
// CMG L. 531-5/6 and D. 531-17…D. 531-24/R. 531-5/6 (package fr.pf.cmg,
// wave 3): D. 531-24 and R. 531-5/R. 531-6 read L. 531-5 and stay out
// although the inventory range names them.
//
// FINISH D72 transfer (08.10.2026, author input only): D. 532-1 (pregnancy
// declaration within the first 14 weeks, both wordings — the 2023 wording
// only renames the form instrument from «arrêté» to «formulaire homologué»)
// and D. 532-2 (suspension of PAJE payment on the PMI doctor's request).
// The three edition blocks below are hand-written; their *.txt,
